~ start
match PlayerStats.curr_level
	when "start"
		if not PlayerStats.in_photo
			match PlayerStats.scene_progress
				when 0
					Joshua: Don't keep the delivery guy waiting.
				when 1
					Joshua: So what was that about?
					Max: This old-timey camera from my parents apparently? Not sure what it’s about. Something about reliving the past.
					Martin: I mean, a camera is used for pictures, ain’t it. Cmon, snap a photo of us right now!
					Max: If you say so.
					do show_instruction()
		else
			match PlayerStats.scene_progress
				when 1
					Max: Guys? Hello?...
					Max: What on earth is happening.
					Max: It seems as if... they’re frozen in time.
					Max: They also look… younger?
					$> PlayerStats.has_talked_house = true
	when "store_inside"
		match PlayerStats.scene_progress
			when 0
				Joshua: Feel free to take a look around. There’s a ton of things here that you can bring back.
				Max: Really trying to market to your friend, huh?
				Joshua: Yeah, well after my dad retired, someone has to keep the store running.
			when 2
				Joshua: I’ll go close up the store. You go on ahead.
=> END